# Title: Emoji by name (Compose Compose name)
# Written for this extension. The scheme (press Compose twice,
# then the emoji's name) comes from WinCompose; the names here are short and
# guessable rather than full Unicode names, and limited to popular emoji: the
# ChromeOS emoji picker covers the rest. Colourful (emoji-presentation) forms,
# with U+FE0F where a character defaults to text style.
# Licence: Apache-2.0 (the extension's own).

# faces
<Multi_key> <Multi_key> <s> <m> <i> <l> <e> : "😄"  # GRINNING FACE WITH SMILING EYES
<Multi_key> <Multi_key> <g> <r> <i> <n> : "😁"  # BEAMING FACE WITH SMILING EYES
<Multi_key> <Multi_key> <j> <o> <y> : "😂"  # FACE WITH TEARS OF JOY
<Multi_key> <Multi_key> <r> <o> <f> <l> : "🤣"  # ROLLING ON THE FLOOR LAUGHING
